[TITLE]
SIM-12: a 5-second hydraulic step with a rule (no rule step given)

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID  Elev  Demand
 J1  0     100

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID  Head
 R1  100

[TANKS]
;ID  Elev  InitLevel  MinLevel  MaxLevel  Diameter  MinVol
 T1  50    10         0         20        30        0

[PIPES]
;ID  Node1  Node2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1     J1     1000    8     100    0      Open
 P2  J1     T1     1000    8     100    0      Open

[RULES]
RULE 1
IF SYSTEM TIME > 0:00:20
THEN PIPE P2 STATUS IS CLOSED

[TIMES]
 Duration            0:01:00
 Hydraulic Timestep  0:00:05    ; under 10 s, so Hstep/10 is 0
 Report Timestep     0:01:00

[REPORT]
 Status   No
 Summary  No

[OPTIONS]
 Units      GPM
 Headloss   H-W

[END]
